# The Queen Ant (29001) and a monster of her clan beside her, every draw 0. The level 1
# character's hit on the monster calls her: 300 away from the character (over 150, a draw under
# 3 then one under 80) she wants strike 4018 on it from where she stands, and to attack it by
# 22 / 440 / 0.05 * 500. She starts the strike at once.
character Hunter 1
random always 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.boss.queenant.QueenAnt
npc queen 29001 GrandBoss 300 0 0 clan ant_clan 300 skill BUFF 4017 1 skill DD_MAGIC 4018 1 skill DD_MAGIC_A 4019 1 skill DEBUFF 4515 1 skill DEBUFF_A 4215 1
npc guard 20120 Monster 300 50 0 clan ant_clan 300

hit guard 22
  S MagicSkillUse caster=queen target=player skill=4018-1 hit=2907 reuse=0 success=0
  desires queen cast(player,4018)=1000000 attack(player)=500
